{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33299","headline":"旅馆秋思 · 于濆","name":"旅馆秋思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅馆坐孤寂，出门成苦吟。\n何事觉归晚，黄花秋意深。\n寒蝶恋衰草，轸我离乡心。\n更见庭前树，南枝巢宿禽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}